    {
      "block_id": "2605.00224_p4_b1",
      "text": "Figure 2. Overview of the TUR-DPO framework. TUR-DPO extracts sub-claims from each response, builds a reasoning topology, and\nverifies claim-level factuality. Semantic, topology, and uncertainty signals (derived from perturbed reasoning graphs and node-level\nverification probabilities) are combined into a shaped reward r\u03d5 and an uncertainty-based weight that modulate the DPO loss for robust\npreference optimization.\n",
